l revenue.","The top line has compounded at -6% over the past three years and +8% annually across the full decade, and a shrinking top line is the hardest headwind any business can overcome.","Returns on capital run at 8% against a 8% cost of capital, which means the business barely earns its keep economically.","On the balance sheet, debt is heavy at 4.6\u00d7 net debt/EBITDA, and leverage like that is what turns a bad year into a permanent loss, and thin -1.3\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Shareholder yield is only 1.0%, a thin return of capital, and insiders hold 3.8% of the shares, and profit capture is only 0.0\u00d7 the fair share, suggesting no structural edge inside its industry."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (-0.8) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Operating margins 38% below sector median \u2014 a cost disadvantage the moat cannot hide","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Piotroski score 4/9 \u2014 below the median for a healthy business","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Value-trap profile (score 57/100): leveraged balance sheet under pressure; roic below cost of capital \u2014 cheapness may reflect deterioration, not mispricing","sev":"amber","cat":"value_trap"},{"text":"Carries more leverage than most Energy peers \u2014 a smaller cushion for the inevitable bad year","sev":"amber","cat":"balance_sheet"},{"text":"The commodity cycle \u2014 revenue and free cash flow are ultimately hostage to a price the company does not set, and the long-run energy-transition arc adds a structural overhang.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"ESG-driven capital flight and stranded asset risk \u2014 tightening climate policy and investor mandates raise the cost of capital and risk leaving reserves permanently in the ground.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Geopolitical supply shocks \u2014 wars, sanctions, and OPEC decisions create volatility that no hedging programme can fully neutralise.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Valued at a 41% discount to sector median EV/EBITDA","Energy sector outperforming the broader market over the past quarter","Energy ETF in a sustained uptrend above its long-term average"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Analyzing Hess Midstream Partners (NYSE:HESM) & Gran Tierra Energy (NYSE:GTE)","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/13/analyzing-hess-midstream-partners-nysehesm-gran-tierra-energy-nysegte.html","date":"2026-11-13","timestamp":1794590185.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.934,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"(GTE) and the Role of Price-Sensitive Allocations","source":"news.stocktradersdaily.com","link":"https://news.stocktradersdaily.com/news_release/34/GTE_and_the_Role_of_Price-Sensitive_Allocations_110726124001_1794030001.html","date":"2026-11-07","timestamp":1794030001.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.273,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Gran Tierra targets sale close before year-end while planning first Azerbaijan drilling in H1 next year (NYSE:GTE)","source":"seekingalpha.com","link":"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4668637-gran-tierra-targets-sale-close-before-year-end-while-planning-first-azerbaijan-drilling-in-h1","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1794001637.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.7,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Gran Tierra Energy (GTE) Q3 2026 Earnings Call Transcript","source":"fool.com","link":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/06/gran-tierra-energy-gte-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/?source=iedfolrf0000001","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793986223.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.527,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Precision Trading